{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M7UiuzaQKPFs9s82abrTxd","type":"tool_result","content":"829\t| acolyte | Acolyte | Cleric 1 | mace, staff | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 55/26/10/10/15/10 | 5/2/.7/.9/1.5/.8 | Mend (1), Purify (5) | priest at 10 |\n830\t| priest | Priest | Cleric 2 | mace, staff | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 3 | 7 | | | Renewal (10), Ward of Seasons (14) | hierophant at 20 + Writ |\n831\t| hierophant | Hierophant | Cleric 3 | staff | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 4 | 8 | | | Greater Renewal (20), Dawnlight (24) | — |\n832\t| tamer | Tamer | Beast 1 | whip, spear | Lash 0.8, range 1–2 | 5 | 3 | 7 | 62/12/14/12/10/13 | 6/.9/1.2/1.1/.7/1.1 | Goad (3) | beastlord at 10 |\n833\t| beastlord | Beastlord | Beast 2 | whip, spear | Lash | 5 | 4 | 10 | | | Pack Tactics (10), Roar (14) | beastsovereign at 20 + Writ |\n834\t| beastsovereign | Beast Sovereign | Beast 3 | spear, whip | Lash | 5 | 4 | 13 | | | Call of the Wild (20), Bond of Fang (24) | — |\n835\t| springwarden | Springwarden | ruler | sword | Slash 1.0 | 5 | 4 | 10 | 75/22/17/15/15/14 | 7/1.5/1.5/1.3/1.3/1.1 | Mend (1), Charge (1), Verdant Oath (6), Bramble Storm (10), Verdant Tempest (16) | — |\n836\t| sunsovereign | Sun Sovereign | ruler | greatsword | Cleave 1.1 | 5 | 4 | 11 | 85/14/21/16/10/12 | 8/1/1.9/1.4/.8/1 | Charge (1), Warcry (6), Cinder Storm (10), Solar Flare (16) | — |\n837\t| harvestking | Harvest King | ruler | staff | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 5 | 10 | 68/30/11/13/20/10 | 6/2/.8/1.2/1.8/.8 | Mend (1), Gale of Leaves (1), Quiet Counsel (6), Harvest Moon (12), Reaping (16) | — |\n838\t| rimeduke | Rime Duke | ruler | staff | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 4 | 10 | 70/28/15/13/19/13 | 6.5/1.8/1.3/1.1/1.7/1 | Hoarfrost (1), Mad Gambit (6), Frost Storm (10), Frozen Hour (12), Blizzard (16) | — |\n839\t| chancellor | Chancellor of Hours | ruler | rod | Strike 0.8 | 4 | 4 | 12 | 80/34/12/15/22/12 | 7/2/1/1.4/1.9/.9 | Time Shear (1), Stop (1), Restore (6), Hour Storm (10) | — |\n840\t| hourmaiden | Hourmaiden | unique | staff | Strike 0.8 | 5 | 3 | 6 | 58/34/9/11/19/15 | 5/2.2/.6/1/1.8/1.2 | Mend (1), Haste (1), Turning (8) | — |\n841\t| graynight | Knight of the Thirteenth Hour | boss | long sword | Slash 1.2 | 5 | 5 | — | fixed (§6.5.5) | — | Thirteenth Stroke, Still, Unmaking, Timeless | — |\n842\t| brigand | Brigand Captain | unique | axe | Hack 1.05 | 5 | 3 | 8 | 72/6/18/13/6/12 | 7/.4/1.6/1.2/.3/1 | Charge (1), Ambush (1) | — |\n843\t\n844\t**A knight's element picks its spells.** \"Bolt\", \"Hex\", \"Storm\" and \"Tempest\" mean that element's spell of that tier\n845\t(§6.7). An Adept of Winter learns Hoarfrost, then Frostbite.\n846\t\n847\t### 6.7 Skills and spells\n848\tAreas:\n849\t- `single`;\n850\t- `r1` / `r2`: the target hex plus every hex within 1 or 2 of it;\n851\t- `self-r1` / `self-r2`: around the user;\n852\t- `adj`: the 6 hexes around the user;\n853\t- `cone2` / `cone3`: hexes within 2 or 3 of the user, inside a 120° wedge facing one of the 6 directions;\n854\t- `line3` / `line4`: a straight hex line from the user in one of the 6 directions.\n855\t\n856\t\"Foes\" or \"allies\" filters who is touched. Status numbers are the base chance (§5.6). P is the power; a heal's P is the\n857\tbase amount.\n858\t\n859\t| id | Name | Kind | Elem | P | Range | Area | MP | Mobile | Effect / notes |\n860\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n861\t| rally | Rally | special | — | — | self | self-r1 allies | 4 | yes | Valor 2 bells |\n862\t| charge | Charge | special | user's | 1.3 | 1 | single | 5 | yes | must move 2+ hexes first |\n863\t| shieldwall | Shield Wall | special | — | — | self | adj allies | 6 | yes | Warded 1 bell |\n864\t| holystrike | Holy Strike | special | none | 1.5 | 1 | single | 8 | yes | ignores element; ×1.5 vs Hour |\n865\t| layonhands | Lay on Hands | special | — | heal 60 | 1 | single ally | 10 | yes | |\n866\t| aimedshot | Aimed Shot | special | user's | 1.2 | 2–4 | single | 4 | no | +20 hit |\n867\t| volley | Volley | special | user's | 0.8 | 3–5 | r1 | 8 | no | |\n868\t| pinning | Pinning Shot | special | user's | 0.9 | 2–4 | single | 6 | yes | Chill 70 |\n869\t| piercing | Piercing Arrow | special | user's | 1.1 | — | line4 | 10 | no | every unit on the line |\n870\t| eagleeye | Eagle Eye | passive | | | | | | | bows +1 max range |\n871\t| bramble, cinder, galeleaves, hoarfrost, timeshear | Bramble / Cinder / Gale of Leaves / Hoarfrost / Time Shear (Bolts) | spell | Sp / Su / Au / Wi / Hour | 14 | 1–4 | single | 5 | no | Time Shear ignores the Tide |\n872\t| drowse, kindle, rot, frostbite, stophex | Drowse / Kindle / Rot / Frostbite / Stop (Hexes) | spell | Sp / Su / Au / Wi / Hour | — | 1–4 | single | 6 | no | Sleep 60 / Burn 70 / Poison 70 / Chill 70 / Stop 40 |\n873\t| bramblestorm, cinderstorm, leafstorm, froststorm, hourstorm | Bramble / Cinder / Leaf / Frost / Hour Storm | spell | Sp / Su / Au / Wi / Hour | 22 | 1–4 | r1 | 10 | no | Cinder Storm on a forest sets it burning (§5.7) |\n874\t| verdanttempest, solarflare, harvestmoon, blizzard | Verdant Tempest / Solar Flare / Harvest Moon / Blizzard (Tempests) | spell | Sp / Su / Au / Wi | 34 | 1–5 | r2 | 16 | no | Sleep 20 / Burn 30 (and burns forests) / drains 25% of damage to the caster / Chill 30 |\n875\t| manasiphon | Mana Siphon | spell | — | — | 1–4 | single | 2 | no | steals 12 MP |\n876\t| haste | Haste | spell | — | — | 0–3 | single ally | 8 | no | Haste 2 bells |\n877\t| mend | Mend | spell | — | heal 30 | 0–3 | single ally | 5 | no | |\n878\t| purify | Purify | spell | — | — | 0–3 | single ally | 4 | no | clears statuses and debuffs |\n879\t| renewal | Renewal | spell | — | heal 24 | 0–3 | r1 allies | 10 | no | |\n880\t| wardofseasons | Ward of Seasons | spell | — | — | 0–3 | r1 allies | 9 | no | Warded 2 bells |\n881\t| greaterrenewal | Greater Renewal | spell | — | heal 36 | 0–4 | r2 allies | 16 | no | |\n882\t| dawnlight | Dawnlight | spell | none | 26 | 1–4 | r1 foes | 14 | no | ×1.5 vs Hour; ignores the Tide |\n883\t| goad | Goad | special | — | — | 1–2 | one own monster | 3 | yes | Valor and Haste 1 bell |\n884\t| packtactics | Pack Tactics | passive | | | | | | | the knight's monsters +10 hit |\n885\t| roar | Roar | special | — | — | self | self-r2 foes | 6 | yes | Weakened 60 |\n886\t| callofwild | Call of the Wild | special | — | 20% max HP | self | own troop's monsters | 12 | yes | heals |\n887\t| bondoffang | Bond of Fang | special | — | — | Ward | one own monster in Ward | 10 | yes | Valor, Warded and Haste 2 bells |\n888\t| verdantoath | Verdant Oath | special | Sp | heal 10% | self | allies in Ward | 10 | yes | Warded 2 bells |\n889\t| warcry | Warcry | special | Su | — | self | allies in Ward | 8 | yes | Valor 2 bells |\n890\t| quietcounsel | Quiet Counsel | special | Au | — | self | allies in Ward | 10 | yes | Haste 1 bell |\n891\t| reaping | Reaping | spell | Au | 20 | 1–3 | single | 8 | no | heals the caster 50% of the damage |\n892\t| madgambit | Mad Gambit | special | Wi | 30 (magic) | 1–3 | single | 6 | yes | 25%: misfires and Chills the Duke instead |\n893\t| frozenhour | Frozen Hour | spell | Wi | — | 1–4 | single | 12 | no | Stop 70 |\n894\t| restore | Restore | spell | Hour | 50% max HP | 0–3 | single ally | 14 | no | |\n895\t| turning | Turning | special | none | 40 (magic) | 1–3 | r1 foes | 0, once per battle | yes | ×2 vs Hour; a Gray Knight it hits loses Timeless until the end of the next bell |\n896\t| ambush | Ambush | passive | | | | | | | +30% damage when attacking from a forest hex |\n897\t| thirteenthstroke | Thirteenth Stroke | special | Hour | 1.6 | 1 | r1 foes | 0 | yes | |\n898\t| still | Still | special | Hour | — | self | self-r2 foes | 0, every 3rd bell | yes | Stop 70 |\n899\t| unmaking | Unmaking | spell | Hour | 25% of target's max HP | 1–3 | single | 20 | no | ignores DEF, element and Tide |\n900\t| timeless | Timeless | passive | | | | | | | immune to effects and the Tide; takes ×0.5 damage until the four Season Dials are lit (§6.10) or Turning hits |\n901\t| pollenpuff | Pollen Puff | special | Sp | — | self | self-r1 foes | 6 | yes | Sleep 50 |\n902\t| entangle | Entangle | special | Sp | 0.6 | 1–2 | single | 5 | no | Chill 70 |\n903\t| scream | Mandrake Scream | special | Sp | — | self | self-r2 foes | 10 | no | Sleep 50 |\n904\t| sleepdust | Sleep Dust | spell | Sp | — | 1–3 | r1 foes | 8 | no | Sleep 60 |\n905\t| thorns | Thorns | passive | | | | | | | melee attackers take 10% of the damage they deal |\n906\t| rootsweep | Root Sweep | special | Sp | 0.9 | — | adj foes | 6 | yes | |\n907\t| dive | Dive | special | user's | 1.2 | 1 | single | 4 | yes | fliers; must move 2+ hexes first |\n908\t| torrent | Torrent | special | Sp | 1.0 | — | line3 | 6 | no | |\n909\t| coil | Coil | special | user's | 0.8 | 1 | single | 4 | yes | Chill 60 |\n910\t| emberspit | Ember Spit | special | Su | 0.9 | 1–2 | single | 3 | yes | Burn 30 |\n911\t| firebreath | Fire Breath | special | Su | 1.2 | — | cone2 (dragons: cone3) | 8 | no | Burn 25 |\n912\t| howl | Howl | special | — | — | self | self-r2 allies | 5 | yes | Valor 1 bell |\n913\t| pounce | Pounce | special | user's | 1.2 | 1 | single | 5 | yes | |\n914\t| rebirth | Rebirth | passive | | | | | | | once per battle, at 0 HP it rises again with 30% HP |\n915\t| sunriddle | Sun Riddle | special | Su | — | self | self-r1 foes | 8 | no | Sleep 50 |\n916\t| wispfire | Wisp Fire | special | Au | 0.9 (magic) | 1–3 | single | 4 | yes | |\n917\t| fear | Fear | special | Au | — | self | self-r1 foes | 5 | yes | Weakened 60 |\n918\t| drain | Drain | special | user's | 1.0 | 1 | single | 4 | yes | heals 50% of the damage |\n919\t| gravechill | Grave Chill | special | Wi | — | self | self-r1 foes | 7 | no | Chill 40 |\n920\t| gale | Gale | special | Au | 0.7 | 1 | single | 5 | yes | pushes the target 1 hex away; if blocked, 4 more damage |\n921\t| trample | Trample | special | user's | 1.0 | — | line3 | 6 | yes | |\n922\t| thickhide | Thick Hide | passive | | | | | | | DEF +10% |\n923\t| frostarmor | Frost Armor | special | Wi | — | self | self | 5 | yes | DEF +40% 2 bells |\n924\t| avalanche | Avalanche | special | Wi | 1.0 | 1–2 | r1 | 9 | no | |\n925\t| hurlice | Hurl Ice | special | Wi | 1.0 | 2–3 | single | 5 | no | |\n926\t| frostfang | Frost Fang | passive | | | | | | | basic attacks Chill 30 |\n927\t| frostbreath | Frost Breath | special | Wi | 1.2 | — | cone3 | 8 | no | Chill 40 |\n928\t| tailsweep | Tail Sweep | special | user's | 0.9 | — | adj foes | 6 | yes | |\n929\t| windup | Wind-up | special | — | — | self | self | 3 | yes | its next basic attack ×1.5 |\n930\t| pendulum | Pendulum | special | Hour | 1.1 | — | adj foes | 6 | yes | |\n931\t| stopbite | Stopping Bite | passive | | | | | | | basic attacks Stop 20 |\n932\t| engulf | Engulf | special | user's | 0.9 | 1 | single | 4 | yes | Poison 40 |\n933\t| regenerate | Regenerate | passive | | | | | | | heals 10% max HP at its turn start |\n934\t| groundpound | Ground Pound | special | user's | 1.0 | — | adj foes | 7 | yes | |\n935\t| screech | Screech | special | — | — | self | self-r1 foes | 5 | yes | Weakened 60 |\n936\t\n937\t### 6.8 Bestiary (30 species, 3 forms each)\n938\t**Form and level rules:**\n939\t- Tier 2 = tier 1 × 1.35 (HP, MP, ATK, DEF, INT), AGI +2. Tier 3 = tier 1 × 1.75, AGI +4, MOV +1 for fliers.\n940\t- At level L, every stat is `round(formBase × (1 + 0.05 × (L − 1)))`.\n941\t- Rank is the bond cost and doesn't change with form. Upkeep ×1.5 at tier 2 and ×2 at tier 3.\n942\t- Each form keeps the skills before it and adds its own (column \"Skills\").\n943\t\n944\tFlags: `fl` flier, `sw` swimmer, `fo` floater. The \"Rig\" column is the look; §7.5 defines the rig kinds.\n945\t\n946\t| id | Forms | Elem | Size | Rank | Flags | Tier 1: HP/MP/ATK/DEF/INT/AGI/MOV | Basic attack (P, range) | Skills: T1; +T2; +T3 | Cost / upkeep | Rig |\n947\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n948\t| sproutling | Sproutling → Bloomkin → Mandragora | Sp | S | 